    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, your restorative spells are guided by the hand of your ancestors. Whenever you use a spell of 1st level or higher to restore hit points to a creature and roll a 1 or 2, you can reroll the die and must use the new roll, even if the new roll is a 1 or a 2.</p>",
